1
00:00:04,004 --> 00:00:05,255
Kerahkan pasukan!

2
00:00:05,338 --> 00:00:07,132
Meski kalah jumlah dan kekuatan,

3
00:00:07,215 --> 00:00:11,094
Yukimura membangun Sanadamaru
dan memukul mundur pasukan Tokugawa.

4
00:00:11,177 --> 00:00:12,429
Mengesankan…

5
00:00:12,512 --> 00:00:13,388
Perdamaian?

6
00:00:13,471 --> 00:00:16,391
Ketika kedua pihak
mendekati gencatan senjata,

7
00:00:16,975 --> 00:00:19,394
Saizo, yang diutus menyelamatkan Sasuke,

8
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:24,023
lenyap tanpa suara dari medan perang
di tangan Hanzo.

9
00:00:29,529 --> 00:00:31,448
Kenapa kau tak bisa melindunginya?

10
00:00:42,292 --> 00:00:44,627
Kenapa kau tak bisa melindunginya?

11
00:00:52,093 --> 00:00:54,012
Kenapa kau tak bisa melindunginya?

12
00:00:59,768 --> 00:01:01,269
Kenapa?

13
00:01:02,103 --> 00:01:03,438
Kenapa?

14
00:01:05,732 --> 00:01:07,650
Kenapa kau tak membalasku?

15
00:01:08,359 --> 00:01:10,153
Ayo, pukul aku!

16
00:01:17,243 --> 00:01:19,746
Balas aku dan katakan

17
00:01:21,289 --> 00:01:23,041
bahwa Saizo masih hidup!

18
00:01:23,875 --> 00:01:25,126
Ayo!

19
00:01:25,668 --> 00:01:27,921
Kubilang pukul aku!

20
00:01:28,463 --> 00:01:29,923
Pukul aku!

21
00:01:30,006 --> 00:01:32,050
Kini kita juga kehilangan Saizo.

22
00:01:33,384 --> 00:01:35,345
Apa yang harus kita lakukan?

23
00:01:38,723 --> 00:01:41,434
Jika kita berperang dengan Tokugawa lagi…

24
00:01:42,143 --> 00:01:43,478
Kita sudah berdamai.

25
00:01:44,145 --> 00:01:45,980
Tak perlu khawatir soal itu.

26
00:01:47,607 --> 00:01:49,192
Aku tak yakin.

27
00:01:50,485 --> 00:01:51,903
Kita hanya bisa berdoa.

28
00:01:53,363 --> 00:01:56,991
Sebagai bukti perdamaian,
Sanadamaru dibongkar

29
00:01:57,075 --> 00:02:00,912
dan parit-parit Kastel Osaka ditimbun.

30
00:02:00,995 --> 00:02:04,499
Namun, justru inilah siasat Ieyasu.

31
00:02:05,375 --> 00:02:07,127
Apa perjanjian damai menyebutkan

32
00:02:07,210 --> 00:02:09,629
Tokugawa tak akan menyerang Osaka
tanpa pertahanan?

33
00:02:11,089 --> 00:02:12,423
Sungguh bodoh.

34
00:02:13,842 --> 00:02:15,301
Bodoh, katamu?

35
00:02:17,011 --> 00:02:17,929
Diam!

36
00:02:21,141 --> 00:02:27,021
Demi menumpas Toyotomi selamanya,
Ieyasu tak menunjukkan belas kasihan.

37
00:02:27,105 --> 00:02:31,276
Setelah melucuti pertahanan Kastel Osaka,

38
00:02:31,359 --> 00:02:35,780
dia memanfaatkan keberadaan samurai
tak bertuan di kastel

39
00:02:35,864 --> 00:02:40,160
sebagai dalih
dan kembali menghimpun pasukannya.

40
00:02:42,829 --> 00:02:43,997
Ibu…

41
00:02:48,334 --> 00:02:50,670
Yukimura benar.

42
00:02:52,213 --> 00:02:55,008
Apakah ini akhirnya?

43
00:02:56,301 --> 00:02:57,510
Hideyori…

44
00:02:57,594 --> 00:02:58,678
Bagaimanapun juga,

45
00:02:59,304 --> 00:03:02,557
kau harus tetap hidup.

46
00:03:06,144 --> 00:03:10,398
Makhluk setengah iblis bersayap
bersembunyi jauh di selatan.

47
00:03:11,649 --> 00:03:14,152
Ternyata benar-benar ada.

48
00:03:14,235 --> 00:03:15,069
Kemari.

49
00:03:16,654 --> 00:03:19,782
Bahkan Sanada tak berdaya
melawan serangan dari atas.

50
00:03:19,866 --> 00:03:22,994
Kubuatkan obat ini khusus untukmu.

51
00:03:23,912 --> 00:03:25,705
Ini, telanlah.

52
00:03:26,497 --> 00:03:29,626
Ini akan memberimu
kekuatan yang lebih besar.

53
00:03:33,296 --> 00:03:35,381
Berikan aku…

54
00:03:37,467 --> 00:03:40,386
tumbal manusia.

55
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:44,807
Apa kau begitu ingin membunuh?

56
00:03:45,975 --> 00:03:47,477
Panggil Imbeyama.

57
00:03:48,144 --> 00:03:48,978
Hanzo.

58
00:03:49,979 --> 00:03:50,813
Ya, Tuanku.

59
00:03:50,897 --> 00:03:53,733
Sanada akan bertindak lagi.

60
00:03:55,151 --> 00:03:58,613
Dia belum cukup menderita,

61
00:03:59,614 --> 00:04:00,782
tetapi tak masalah.

62
00:04:02,575 --> 00:04:03,618
Bunuh dia!

63
00:04:04,535 --> 00:04:05,954
Akan kulaksanakan.

64
00:04:06,037 --> 00:04:08,623
Jangan mengecewakanku lagi.

65
00:04:13,253 --> 00:04:14,921
Kau paham

66
00:04:15,505 --> 00:04:16,714
betapa beratnya janjimu?

67
00:04:17,423 --> 00:04:18,258
Ya.

68
00:04:19,008 --> 00:04:20,551
Jika gagal lagi,

69
00:04:20,635 --> 00:04:23,388
ambisi seumur hidupmu akan sia-sia.

70
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:26,349
Utamakan tugasmu.

71
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:30,144
Pertaruhkan nyawamu
untuk menunaikan tugasmu,

72
00:04:30,228 --> 00:04:34,565
maka Ogosho pasti akan mengakui jasamu.

73
00:04:43,908 --> 00:04:44,993
Hanzo.

74
00:04:46,911 --> 00:04:48,246
Kubawakan

75
00:04:49,622 --> 00:04:54,002
peta posisi pasukan Toyotomi dan Sanada.

76
00:04:54,752 --> 00:04:56,379
Kau mengkhianati tuanmu

77
00:04:57,255 --> 00:04:59,465
tanpa rasa bersalah?

78
00:05:00,508 --> 00:05:03,261
Mengorbankan nyawa demi satu tuan
adalah pengabdian.

79
00:05:03,928 --> 00:05:06,139
Membaca perubahan keadaan

80
00:05:06,222 --> 00:05:08,391
dan mengabdi pada tuan lain

81
00:05:09,100 --> 00:05:10,977
juga sama benarnya.

82
00:05:11,978 --> 00:05:14,105
Sesederhana itu.

83
00:05:31,497 --> 00:05:32,540
Okuni.

84
00:05:32,623 --> 00:05:33,458
Ya, Tuanku.

85
00:05:34,125 --> 00:05:36,753
Ini perintah terakhirmu.

86
00:05:37,962 --> 00:05:39,922
Bunuh Sanada

87
00:05:41,674 --> 00:05:43,509
sebelum perang dimulai.

88
00:05:44,469 --> 00:05:45,470
Baik, Tuanku.

89
00:05:46,763 --> 00:05:48,514
SANADA DAISUKE
SANADA YUKIMURA

90
00:05:49,098 --> 00:05:50,558
Apa katamu?

91
00:05:51,142 --> 00:05:54,103
Aku ingin Tuan Hideyori
turun ke medan perang

92
00:05:54,771 --> 00:05:56,856
sebagai komandan pasukan Toyotomi.

93
00:05:57,648 --> 00:05:59,442
Dengan begitu,

94
00:06:00,318 --> 00:06:02,028
kita masih berpeluang menang.

95
00:06:20,004 --> 00:06:21,506
Tak mungkin.

96
00:06:21,589 --> 00:06:23,341
Hideyori tak akan kukirim berperang.

97
00:06:23,424 --> 00:06:26,552
Apa Nyonya melihat wajah para prajurit?

98
00:06:27,136 --> 00:06:29,847
Seolah-olah mereka hanya menunggu ajal.

99
00:06:30,389 --> 00:06:32,141
Kita terjerumus perangkap Tokugawa.

100
00:06:32,225 --> 00:06:36,437
Bahkan Tuan Urakusai, yang menegosiasikan
perdamaian, menghilang.

101
00:06:36,521 --> 00:06:37,730
Semangat juang menurun.

102
00:06:39,941 --> 00:06:41,818
Namun, jika Tuan Hideyori berperang,

103
00:06:42,318 --> 00:06:46,656
semangat juang mereka
mungkin bangkit kembali.

104
00:06:46,739 --> 00:06:51,369
Pada saat yang sama, pasukan Tokugawa
akan berebut mendapatkan kepalanya.

105
00:06:51,452 --> 00:06:54,330
Barisan mereka akan tercerai,
membuat markas mereka terbuka.

106
00:06:54,413 --> 00:06:55,790
Kumanfaatkan kesempatan itu

107
00:06:56,415 --> 00:07:00,419
untuk memenggal Ieyasu dengan ninjaku.

108
00:07:00,503 --> 00:07:01,796
Serangan kejutan?

109
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:04,799
Memang bisa membalikkan keadaan
dalam satu serangan.

110
00:07:04,882 --> 00:07:07,426
Namun, itu pedang bermata dua.

111
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:09,554
Kau tak akan bisa lolos begitu saja.

112
00:07:09,637 --> 00:07:10,596
Aku tahu risikonya.

113
00:07:10,680 --> 00:07:11,931
Namun, Hideyori…

114
00:07:12,014 --> 00:07:13,558
Bukankah kita harus percaya

115
00:07:13,641 --> 00:07:15,435
kepada Tuan Yukimura?

116
00:07:16,102 --> 00:07:17,311
Harunaga!

117
00:07:17,395 --> 00:07:21,357
Aku juga enggan mengirim
Tuan Hideyori ke medan perang.

118
00:07:21,441 --> 00:07:23,067
- Namun…
- Apa kita…

119
00:07:24,402 --> 00:07:25,778
sungguh berpeluang

120
00:07:27,447 --> 00:07:29,407
jika aku turun ke medan perang?

121
00:07:32,118 --> 00:07:33,244
Ya.

122
00:07:33,327 --> 00:07:34,370
Hideyori?

123
00:07:36,914 --> 00:07:37,915
Baiklah.

124
00:07:40,042 --> 00:07:41,544
Aku memercayaimu.

125
00:07:47,049 --> 00:07:49,051
Tekad Tuan patut dikagumi.

126
00:07:51,220 --> 00:07:53,181
Aku mengerti rencanamu.

127
00:07:54,599 --> 00:07:57,351
Mengingat semua pencapaianmu, Yukimura,

128
00:07:58,686 --> 00:08:00,980
aku tahu harus memercayaimu.

129
00:08:03,149 --> 00:08:04,192
Namun…

130
00:08:05,735 --> 00:08:07,862
Aku mengerti perasaanmu. Namun…

131
00:08:07,945 --> 00:08:09,238
Kau tak mengerti!

132
00:08:09,780 --> 00:08:11,157
Kau tak mengerti apa pun.

133
00:08:15,786 --> 00:08:17,205
Aku takut.

134
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:22,001
Aku melihat dayangku tewas
di depan mataku.

135
00:08:25,421 --> 00:08:28,341
Aku tak mau ada yang tewas lagi.

136
00:08:28,925 --> 00:08:29,759
Kemungkinan,

137
00:08:30,384 --> 00:08:32,970
Ieyasu akan menyerang habis-habisan besok.

138
00:08:33,888 --> 00:08:36,098
Jika diam saja,
kita semua akan binasa di sini.

139
00:08:36,182 --> 00:08:38,309
Tidak! Bukan itu maksudku!

140
00:08:39,769 --> 00:08:41,145
Lupakan soal strategi.

141
00:08:42,063 --> 00:08:43,272
Aku ingin tahu…

142
00:08:45,149 --> 00:08:47,735
bagaimana perasaanmu sebagai ayahnya.

143
00:08:50,446 --> 00:08:51,572
Hideyori putra kita.

144
00:08:54,825 --> 00:08:57,370
Apa kau tak sedikit pun ragu

145
00:08:59,163 --> 00:09:00,331
untuk mengirimnya

146
00:09:01,582 --> 00:09:03,417
ke medan perang?

147
00:09:08,422 --> 00:09:09,757
Tak sedikit pun.

148
00:09:11,676 --> 00:09:13,052
Ini demi klan Toyotomi.

149
00:09:13,135 --> 00:09:15,638
Aku tak paham! Semua ini tak kupahami…

150
00:09:17,473 --> 00:09:20,893
Jika kau bersikeras
membawa Hideyori ke medan perang…

151
00:09:22,979 --> 00:09:24,272
kau harus…

152
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:27,692
membunuhku di sini sekarang!

153
00:09:37,326 --> 00:09:41,038
Kenapa Pak Tua Yukimura lama sekali?

154
00:09:41,122 --> 00:09:43,374
Toyotomi tak bodoh.

155
00:09:43,457 --> 00:09:48,129
Mereka pasti tahu mengirim Tuan Hideyori
berperang adalah satu-satunya harapan.

156
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:51,382
Maaf sudah menunggu.

157
00:09:51,465 --> 00:09:53,301
Tuan Hideyori akan berperang, 'kan?

158
00:09:53,384 --> 00:09:55,011
Apa langkah kita selanjutnya?

159
00:09:55,094 --> 00:09:57,096
Beri tahu kami rencana Tuan.

160
00:09:58,556 --> 00:09:59,890
Apa isi kotak ini?

161
00:09:59,974 --> 00:10:03,769
Imbalan atas kemenangan kalian
di Sanadamaru.

162
00:10:03,853 --> 00:10:06,147
Semua ini milik kalian.

163
00:10:07,315 --> 00:10:09,108
Siapa peduli soal itu saat ini?

164
00:10:09,692 --> 00:10:13,029
Ini akan cukup untuk hidup sementara.

165
00:10:13,696 --> 00:10:16,532
Tuan Yukimura, jangan-jangan…

166
00:10:18,117 --> 00:10:21,495
Tuan Hideyori tak akan berperang.

167
00:10:22,913 --> 00:10:26,292
Pertahanan kita telah hilang,
dan kita kalah jumlah.

168
00:10:27,126 --> 00:10:30,087
Makin banyak ronin
yang meninggalkan Toyotomi.

169
00:10:30,671 --> 00:10:31,505
Kalau begini…

170
00:10:31,589 --> 00:10:35,051
Bukankah itu alasan kita
membawa Tuan Hideyori berperang?

171
00:10:36,844 --> 00:10:38,262
Beberapa dari kalian

172
00:10:39,972 --> 00:10:42,016
punya keluarga yang menunggu di rumah.

173
00:10:43,517 --> 00:10:45,519
Yang lain punya impian tentang kehidupan

174
00:10:46,729 --> 00:10:48,356
setelah perang ini.

175
00:10:49,815 --> 00:10:50,775
Akulah yang harus

176
00:10:51,567 --> 00:10:53,736
menanggung beban kekalahan ini.

177
00:10:56,781 --> 00:10:59,367
Aku tak bisa melibatkan kalian lebih jauh.

178
00:11:00,660 --> 00:11:01,911
Tunggu…

179
00:11:05,956 --> 00:11:09,418
Dengan ini, Sepuluh Pendekar dibubarkan.

180
00:11:12,755 --> 00:11:14,048
Hei, tunggu!

181
00:11:14,799 --> 00:11:16,300
Jangan harap kami mematuhinya.

182
00:11:16,384 --> 00:11:17,301
Sasuke!

183
00:11:17,385 --> 00:11:20,012
Jika mau menyerah semudah ini,
untuk apa semua ini?

184
00:11:21,806 --> 00:11:24,350
Aku tak peduli
Hideyori berperang atau tidak.

185
00:11:25,267 --> 00:11:26,769
Saizo memercayakan

186
00:11:28,521 --> 00:11:29,772
keselamatanmu padaku.

187
00:11:30,856 --> 00:11:32,483
Dia tahu kau akan terus berjuang

188
00:11:32,566 --> 00:11:33,984
hingga akhir,

189
00:11:34,610 --> 00:11:36,445
apa pun yang terjadi!

190
00:11:38,114 --> 00:11:39,115
Itu sebabnya…

191
00:11:41,325 --> 00:11:43,828
Itu sebabnya dia memintaku melindungimu!

192
00:11:46,705 --> 00:11:47,540
Hei.

193
00:11:48,457 --> 00:11:49,375
Hei, tunggu!

194
00:11:49,458 --> 00:11:50,751
Hei!

195
00:11:53,003 --> 00:11:54,588
Kenapa kalian diam saja?

196
00:11:55,256 --> 00:11:56,799
Mau dibiarkan berakhir?

197
00:11:56,882 --> 00:11:59,927
Tentu saja tidak!

198
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:02,680
Namun…

199
00:12:05,224 --> 00:12:07,435
itu perintah tuan kita.

200
00:12:21,240 --> 00:12:22,783
Boleh aku bertanya?

201
00:12:23,951 --> 00:12:25,494
Haruskah seorang ninja

202
00:12:25,578 --> 00:12:28,080
selalu menuruti tuannya?

203
00:12:29,790 --> 00:12:33,836
Meski dia tak setuju dengan perintahnya?

204
00:12:35,129 --> 00:12:36,881
Ya. Benar.

205
00:12:46,307 --> 00:12:47,600
Sialan!

206
00:13:06,660 --> 00:13:08,245
Ini bagus!

207
00:13:08,329 --> 00:13:10,372
Banyak ruang untuk buka usaha, 'kan?

208
00:13:10,456 --> 00:13:11,290
Ya.

209
00:13:11,373 --> 00:13:13,876
Dengan imbalan itu,
kita bisa membuka kedai.

210
00:13:15,169 --> 00:13:17,421
Namun, tak ada tempat lagi di sebelah.

211
00:13:17,505 --> 00:13:19,590
Kakak bisa buka kedai makan di sini.

212
00:13:19,673 --> 00:13:21,050
Tak bisa.

213
00:13:21,133 --> 00:13:23,385
Keluarga kita hanya kita berdua.

214
00:13:23,469 --> 00:13:25,846
Tak mungkin kita berpisah.

215
00:13:26,805 --> 00:13:28,224
Ayo lihat tempat berikutnya.

216
00:13:35,189 --> 00:13:36,732
Kau baik-baik saja?

217
00:13:39,360 --> 00:13:40,569
Seikai…

218
00:13:40,653 --> 00:13:42,363
Jangan bilang kau…

219
00:13:44,448 --> 00:13:45,658
Mulai sekarang…

220
00:13:48,452 --> 00:13:50,329
jalani hidupmu sendiri.

221
00:13:57,586 --> 00:14:00,548
Kenapa kau…

222
00:14:24,572 --> 00:14:25,573
Selamat tinggal,

223
00:14:26,574 --> 00:14:27,658
Kakak.

224
00:14:32,955 --> 00:14:33,998
Pasang taruhanmu.

225
00:14:35,124 --> 00:14:36,500
Tiga dan dua. Ganjil.

226
00:14:40,462 --> 00:14:42,882
Yang kubutuhkan hanya enam koin.

227
00:14:42,965 --> 00:14:43,841
Berikutnya.

228
00:14:45,551 --> 00:14:46,760
Ganjil atau genap?

229
00:14:51,765 --> 00:14:53,225
Tolong tagihannya.

230
00:14:53,767 --> 00:14:54,685
Baik.

231
00:14:55,686 --> 00:14:57,354
Apa kehidupanmu sulit?

232
00:14:58,480 --> 00:15:00,190
Di mana-mana sama

233
00:15:00,274 --> 00:15:02,067
sejak Tokugawa berkuasa.

234
00:15:08,866 --> 00:15:09,867
Ini untuk minumannya.

235
00:15:11,160 --> 00:15:14,330
Ini terlalu banyak. Kenapa banyak sekali?

236
00:15:17,541 --> 00:15:18,876
Apa kau ayahku?

237
00:15:23,088 --> 00:15:24,089
Sudah kuduga.

238
00:15:44,693 --> 00:15:48,656
Kau berencana menyerang sendirian, 'kan?

239
00:15:50,574 --> 00:15:51,617
Jangan.

240
00:15:52,743 --> 00:15:54,912
Bisa apa kau sendirian?

241
00:15:59,333 --> 00:16:02,169
Aku punya rencana.

242
00:16:06,715 --> 00:16:07,967
Jika kembali hidup-hidup,

243
00:16:08,759 --> 00:16:10,260
ada yang ingin kukatakan.

244
00:16:41,542 --> 00:16:42,793
Apa yang kau lakukan?

245
00:16:46,588 --> 00:16:48,048
Kau tahu…

246
00:16:50,009 --> 00:16:54,054
dia selalu menyesal
telah memberiku bekas luka ini.

247
00:16:57,141 --> 00:16:58,142
Sejak saat itu,

248
00:17:00,102 --> 00:17:04,690
dia bertekad tak akan membiarkan
perasaannya mengaburkan penilaiannya.

249
00:17:08,277 --> 00:17:09,361
Namun, kemudian…

250
00:17:12,031 --> 00:17:13,782
kau datang.

251
00:17:16,618 --> 00:17:18,704
Sedikit demi sedikit, dia berubah.

252
00:17:23,959 --> 00:17:25,252
Menghabiskan

253
00:17:26,503 --> 00:17:28,005
seumur hidupku dengannya…

254
00:17:29,965 --> 00:17:31,050
Hanya itu…

255
00:17:38,098 --> 00:17:40,726
Hanya itu yang kuinginkan.

256
00:17:46,148 --> 00:17:47,524
Setelah semua ini…

257
00:17:49,777 --> 00:17:51,779
untuk apa sebenarnya kita berjuang?

258
00:17:54,698 --> 00:17:57,117
Tak ada yang bisa menggantikan Saizo.

259
00:18:00,162 --> 00:18:01,330
Namun…

260
00:18:03,373 --> 00:18:05,084
setidaknya aku ingin memastikan…

261
00:18:08,128 --> 00:18:10,756
bahwa kematiannya tak sia-sia.

262
00:18:23,435 --> 00:18:24,853
Tuan Sanada,

263
00:18:25,479 --> 00:18:27,523
ada sesuatu yang harus kutanyakan.

264
00:18:28,023 --> 00:18:29,399
Ada apa, Tuan?

265
00:18:31,276 --> 00:18:33,612
Kenapa kau masih berjuang bersama kami?

266
00:18:35,697 --> 00:18:37,741
Karena setia kepada Taiko?

267
00:18:39,076 --> 00:18:40,160
Atau…

268
00:18:42,412 --> 00:18:44,331
karena cinta seorang ayah?

269
00:18:46,166 --> 00:18:47,167
Aku hanya

270
00:18:49,086 --> 00:18:51,296
ingin tahu perasaanmu.

271
00:18:57,970 --> 00:19:01,306
Kenapa kita berjuang?

272
00:19:03,142 --> 00:19:04,643
Demi uang?

273
00:19:06,478 --> 00:19:09,314
Untuk mengukir nama dalam sejarah?

274
00:19:11,066 --> 00:19:12,234
Bukan.

275
00:19:12,776 --> 00:19:16,905
Kita berjuang demi kedamaian negeri ini.

276
00:19:18,365 --> 00:19:21,785
Ini akan mengakhiri
peperangan bertahun-tahun.

277
00:19:22,995 --> 00:19:27,583
Toyotomi sudah tak memiliki kekuatan
untuk melawan.

278
00:19:28,917 --> 00:19:33,714
Demi kedamaian semua orang di negeri ini,

279
00:19:34,590 --> 00:19:37,092
kita melancarkan
serangan besar-besaran besok!

280
00:19:38,552 --> 00:19:39,761
Satu hari.

281
00:19:40,637 --> 00:19:43,765
Rebut Kastel Osaka dalam satu hari!

282
00:19:43,849 --> 00:19:45,350
Baik, Tuanku!

283
00:19:58,197 --> 00:19:59,364
Ada orang di sana?

284
00:20:16,089 --> 00:20:17,299
Kau sungguh berpikir

285
00:20:18,508 --> 00:20:21,136
bisa memenggal Ieyasu sendirian?

286
00:20:28,435 --> 00:20:31,563
Ternyata kau sudah menguasai
seni penyamaran, Sasuke.

287
00:20:32,856 --> 00:20:34,358
Memangnya diperlukan…

288
00:20:35,859 --> 00:20:37,152
Apa maksudmu?

289
00:20:37,236 --> 00:20:39,446
Jika kau mau menipuku,
buang kebiasaan itu.

290
00:20:40,948 --> 00:20:43,992
Sial. Saizo meninggalkan ini.

291
00:20:44,076 --> 00:20:45,661
Lumayan, 'kan?

292
00:20:49,248 --> 00:20:52,793
Jadi, kau mendengar percakapanku
dengan Tuan Matabe.

293
00:20:56,004 --> 00:20:57,923
Menyerang sendirian tanpa rencana?

294
00:20:59,049 --> 00:21:01,218
Kau tak akan ambil risiko begitu.

295
00:21:02,427 --> 00:21:06,390
Aku tak punya pilihan lain.

296
00:21:09,184 --> 00:21:10,435
Maksudku,

297
00:21:11,645 --> 00:21:13,272
aku ikut denganmu.

298
00:21:15,857 --> 00:21:18,193
Kupikir kau melayaniku karena uang,

299
00:21:19,444 --> 00:21:20,862
bukan karena kesetiaan.

300
00:21:23,073 --> 00:21:24,658
Namun, tubuhku…

301
00:21:26,410 --> 00:21:28,078
gatal ingin terus maju.

302
00:21:28,161 --> 00:21:29,997
Rasanya terus disuruh maju.

303
00:21:37,421 --> 00:21:40,549
Boleh aku ikut mengambil risiko itu?

304
00:21:56,690 --> 00:21:57,733
Kalian semua…

305
00:21:58,442 --> 00:22:01,987
Kami sudah dengar tekad Ayah.

306
00:22:02,070 --> 00:22:03,697
Kami juga akan bertarung.

307
00:22:04,281 --> 00:22:08,201
Aku tak pernah percaya pada diriku.

308
00:22:09,494 --> 00:22:10,996
Namun, dengan kalian semua,

309
00:22:11,997 --> 00:22:14,207
mungkin bisa mewujudkan hal yang mustahil.

310
00:22:14,833 --> 00:22:16,585
Berapa peluang kita?

311
00:22:16,668 --> 00:22:19,504
Menurutku, peluang kita hanya satu persen.

312
00:22:19,588 --> 00:22:21,631
Satu persen itu sudah cukup.

313
00:22:23,300 --> 00:22:26,511
Apa gunanya berjudi
jika tak bertaruh untuk jangka panjang?

314
00:22:26,595 --> 00:22:30,474
Kau sudah kalah judi,
makanya harus cari uang lagi, 'kan?

315
00:22:30,557 --> 00:22:32,434
Bisa diam, tidak?

316
00:22:33,018 --> 00:22:34,436
Shakespeare pernah berkata,

317
00:22:34,936 --> 00:22:39,608
"Ada atau tiada, itulah pertanyaannya."

318
00:22:40,734 --> 00:22:41,693
Namun…

319
00:22:42,903 --> 00:22:48,825
tampaknya ninja Sanada
lebih peduli dengan cara hidup mereka.

320
00:22:52,537 --> 00:22:54,623
Di mana Isa dan Pak Tua Mochizuki?

321
00:22:54,706 --> 00:22:56,333
Kakakku tak akan datang.

322
00:22:56,416 --> 00:22:57,876
Begitu juga Mochizuki.

323
00:22:58,835 --> 00:23:00,754
Mereka tak akan melanggar perintah Ayah.

324
00:23:03,006 --> 00:23:04,382
Kalau mau pergi, lakukan.

325
00:23:04,883 --> 00:23:06,510
Peluang kita sangat kecil.

326
00:23:06,593 --> 00:23:07,719
Meski begitu…

327
00:23:10,680 --> 00:23:13,391
Demi rekan-rekan kita yang gugur.

328
00:23:16,812 --> 00:23:18,188
Demi kesetiaan.

329
00:23:22,484 --> 00:23:23,693
Aku menaruh…

330
00:23:26,113 --> 00:23:27,447
kepercayaanku kepadamu.

331
00:23:45,423 --> 00:23:46,842
Baiklah.

332
00:23:47,467 --> 00:23:50,887
Sekarang akan kujelaskan
rencana terakhir kita.

333
00:23:53,014 --> 00:23:56,393
Terima kasih dari lubuk hatiku

334
00:23:56,935 --> 00:23:58,520
karena melanggar perintahku.

335
00:24:06,903 --> 00:24:08,655
Aku tak minta kalian bertahan hidup.

336
00:24:09,197 --> 00:24:12,409
Namun, jangan memilih jalan
yang akan kalian sesali.

337
00:24:13,493 --> 00:24:17,080
Jadikan kata-kata ini pedoman
dalam pertempuran.

338
00:24:18,582 --> 00:24:21,251
Itu perintah terakhirku.

339
00:24:22,502 --> 00:24:23,920
Ini…

340
00:24:30,385 --> 00:24:33,930
Apa yang akan Sanada lakukan besok?

341
00:24:34,014 --> 00:24:37,517
Dia berencana menyerang
markas kita sendirian.

342
00:24:39,644 --> 00:24:40,770
Itu saja?

343
00:24:45,567 --> 00:24:46,526
Aku mendengarnya.

344
00:24:47,819 --> 00:24:50,447
Jantungmu berdebar.

345
00:24:52,324 --> 00:24:54,075
Apa yang telah kau ketahui?

346
00:24:57,662 --> 00:24:59,372
Maafkan aku karena bertanya,

347
00:25:00,874 --> 00:25:02,209
tetapi Tuan Hanzo,

348
00:25:03,084 --> 00:25:06,213
apa Tuan pernah mempertanyakan perintah?

349
00:25:11,259 --> 00:25:13,136
Beri tahu semuanya.

350
00:26:03,728 --> 00:26:04,771
Sekarang…

351
00:26:05,563 --> 00:26:07,357
ia bisa kau perintahkan.

352
00:26:08,441 --> 00:26:09,651
Tepat pada waktunya.

353
00:26:34,467 --> 00:26:36,594
Semuanya siap.

354
00:26:38,054 --> 00:26:43,059
Ini akan menjadi
pertempuran terakhir dalam hidupku.

355
00:26:44,477 --> 00:26:46,021
Saat matahari terbenam,

356
00:26:46,938 --> 00:26:50,358
Ogosho akan menjadi dewa bagi bangsa ini.

357
00:26:58,283 --> 00:27:02,662
PENGEPUNGAN MUSIM PANAS OSAKA

358
00:27:05,457 --> 00:27:06,458
Dia datang.

359
00:27:08,501 --> 00:27:09,753
Kau yakin?

360
00:27:09,836 --> 00:27:11,379
Aku sudah memutuskannya.

361
00:27:12,881 --> 00:27:16,134
Aku akan bertarung bersama Ayah
hingga akhir.

362
00:27:17,802 --> 00:27:20,638
Mari berdoa agar kita meraih kemenangan.

363
00:27:23,308 --> 00:27:24,392
Baik, Ayah.

364
00:27:24,476 --> 00:27:25,560
Tuan Yukimura!

365
00:27:25,643 --> 00:27:26,895
Ada apa?

366
00:27:45,121 --> 00:27:47,499
Hanya ada satu musuh! Jangan panik!

367
00:27:48,249 --> 00:27:50,335
Dia mau mematahkan semangat juang lagi!

368
00:27:50,418 --> 00:27:51,836
Kita harus menahannya,

369
00:27:52,420 --> 00:27:54,756
atau kastel tumbang
sebelum kita memenggal Ieyasu.

370
00:27:59,094 --> 00:28:00,011
Sialan.

371
00:28:00,845 --> 00:28:01,846
Sekali lagi!

372
00:28:04,224 --> 00:28:05,558
Sekali lagi!

373
00:28:06,893 --> 00:28:08,353
Sialan!

374
00:28:09,979 --> 00:28:11,731
Biar monyet yang menangani burung.

375
00:28:18,863 --> 00:28:19,781
Apa itu…

376
00:28:28,373 --> 00:28:29,666
Mochizuki…

377
00:28:29,749 --> 00:28:30,625
Pak Tua!

378
00:28:30,708 --> 00:28:34,838
Aku kembali, melanggar perintah Tuan!

379
00:28:36,381 --> 00:28:38,925
Maafkan aku.

380
00:28:46,641 --> 00:28:48,143
Unno…

381
00:28:48,226 --> 00:28:49,102
UNNO ROKURO

382
00:28:49,185 --> 00:28:50,603
Pinjamkan aku kekuatanmu.

383
00:29:09,748 --> 00:29:12,000
Panah Melengkung, Dewa Liar.

384
00:29:29,851 --> 00:29:32,353
Tembakan bagus, Pak Tua Mochizuki!

385
00:29:35,148 --> 00:29:36,399
Majulah,

386
00:29:37,150 --> 00:29:38,276
burung sialan!

387
00:29:38,359 --> 00:29:39,861
Monyet!

388
00:29:41,237 --> 00:29:42,822
Jangan diserang dari depan!

389
00:29:42,906 --> 00:29:44,616
Tubuhnya dipenuhi peledak!

390
00:29:44,699 --> 00:29:46,409
Tak ada pilihan.

391
00:29:54,959 --> 00:29:56,127
Sasuke.

392
00:29:56,211 --> 00:29:58,046
Kecerobohanmu itu

393
00:29:58,129 --> 00:30:00,799
mengingatkanku kepada Unno saat muda.

394
00:30:02,342 --> 00:30:03,885
Jaga tuan kita.

395
00:30:08,056 --> 00:30:09,307
Pak Tua…

396
00:30:18,358 --> 00:30:19,317
Mochizuki!

397
00:30:20,109 --> 00:30:21,361
Mochizuki!

398
00:30:25,448 --> 00:30:26,866
Magamaru!

399
00:30:26,950 --> 00:30:29,536
Pasukan!

400
00:30:29,619 --> 00:30:31,454
Serbu!

401
00:30:32,288 --> 00:30:33,498
Mereka datang.

402
00:30:34,582 --> 00:30:35,667
Ayo.

403
00:30:36,209 --> 00:30:38,378
Jangan biarkan kematian Mochizuki sia-sia.

404
00:30:44,384 --> 00:30:46,886
Jangan sampai kematian
Tuan Mochizuki sia-sia!

405
00:30:53,768 --> 00:30:55,520
Ikuti aku!

406
00:30:57,981 --> 00:30:59,357
Jangan goyah!

407
00:30:59,983 --> 00:31:02,277
Pasukan kita akan merebut kastel itu.

408
00:31:03,611 --> 00:31:05,405
Serang!

409
00:31:27,302 --> 00:31:28,845
Banyak sekali mereka.

410
00:31:29,554 --> 00:31:31,431
Itu dia! Itu Sanada Yukimura!

411
00:31:31,514 --> 00:31:33,016
- Kita ketahuan!
- Itu Sanada!

412
00:31:33,600 --> 00:31:37,061
Sepertinya kita tak bisa
memenggal kepala Ieyasu semudah itu.

413
00:31:39,731 --> 00:31:41,316
Sialan! Mereka terus berdatangan!

414
00:31:53,161 --> 00:31:54,662
Tuan Hideyori…

415
00:31:58,416 --> 00:32:01,044
- Itu Tuan Hideyori!
- Tuan Hideyori datang!

416
00:32:01,127 --> 00:32:02,754
Tuan Hideyori sudah tiba!

417
00:32:02,837 --> 00:32:04,297
Jangan gentar!

418
00:32:04,380 --> 00:32:06,424
Berdiri dan lawan mereka!

419
00:32:07,675 --> 00:32:09,177
Hideyori ada di medan perang?

420
00:32:10,053 --> 00:32:12,764
Tuan Hideyori ada di sana.

421
00:32:16,059 --> 00:32:17,518
Lalu…

422
00:32:18,311 --> 00:32:19,979
siapa itu?

423
00:32:21,064 --> 00:32:22,523
Tak mungkin…

424
00:32:22,607 --> 00:32:23,900
Laporan, Tuanku!

425
00:32:24,609 --> 00:32:27,820
Komandan musuh Toyotomi Hideyori
telah turun ke medan perang!

426
00:32:27,904 --> 00:32:30,365
Pasukan Toyotomi
memukul mundur pasukan kita!

427
00:32:30,448 --> 00:32:33,534
Sialan! Apa yang kalian lakukan?

428
00:32:33,618 --> 00:32:35,536
Kalau begitu…

429
00:32:43,628 --> 00:32:46,464
Pasukan musuh mulai merapat
di medan perang.

430
00:32:46,547 --> 00:32:47,882
Itu pasti Tuan Daisuke.

431
00:32:48,675 --> 00:32:50,927
Berkat dia, musuhnya lebih sedikit.

432
00:32:51,844 --> 00:32:52,720
Seikai!

433
00:32:53,680 --> 00:32:54,722
Aku baik-baik saja.

434
00:32:57,141 --> 00:32:58,017
Di depan…

435
00:32:58,101 --> 00:33:00,728
Ya, markas Ieyasu.

436
00:33:06,567 --> 00:33:07,527
Itu…

437
00:33:08,361 --> 00:33:10,071
Sayang sekali.

438
00:33:10,947 --> 00:33:13,700
Kami sudah tahu tentang rencana kecilmu.

439
00:33:15,368 --> 00:33:17,620
Pasukan mereka tengah bergerak maju!

440
00:33:17,704 --> 00:33:19,455
Cukup! Mundur!

441
00:33:26,421 --> 00:33:28,131
Itu…

442
00:33:28,214 --> 00:33:29,882
Obat untuk menguatkan Tsuge.

443
00:33:31,759 --> 00:33:34,721
Waktu hidup mereka hanya sebentar.

444
00:33:35,680 --> 00:33:36,597
Namun…

445
00:33:39,726 --> 00:33:43,104
kami hanya butuh waktu sebentar.

446
00:33:51,029 --> 00:33:51,988
Tahan posisi.

447
00:34:04,917 --> 00:34:05,918
Tidak apa-apa.

448
00:34:14,302 --> 00:34:15,803
Kau…

449
00:34:17,013 --> 00:34:19,223
Masih sempat-sempatnya melongo?

450
00:34:19,307 --> 00:34:21,350
Di mana Sanada yang asli?

451
00:34:21,976 --> 00:34:23,895
Mana sudi kuberi tahu.

452
00:34:34,489 --> 00:34:35,823
Simpan tenagamu.

453
00:34:35,907 --> 00:34:38,242
Pertarunganmu bukan di sini.

454
00:34:57,887 --> 00:34:59,597
Seikai, kau luar biasa!

455
00:35:57,780 --> 00:35:58,865
Kakak…

456
00:35:58,948 --> 00:35:59,991
Kau baik-baik saja?

457
00:36:00,950 --> 00:36:02,493
Dasar bodoh.

458
00:36:17,550 --> 00:36:19,677
Palu Besi, Lesus!

459
00:37:10,811 --> 00:37:12,730
Kekuatan yang luar biasa…

460
00:37:23,824 --> 00:37:24,659
Tunggu.

461
00:37:38,172 --> 00:37:39,507
Seikai…

462
00:37:41,676 --> 00:37:42,969
Seikai!

463
00:37:49,267 --> 00:37:50,184
Seikai…

464
00:37:54,063 --> 00:37:55,106
Seikai?

465
00:37:57,191 --> 00:37:58,776
- Isa!
- Seikai…

466
00:37:58,859 --> 00:38:00,444
Matamu…

467
00:38:03,322 --> 00:38:04,490
Seikai…

468
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:14,959
Sasuke…

469
00:38:16,377 --> 00:38:18,087
Bagaimana Seikai?

470
00:38:25,678 --> 00:38:26,971
Dia baik-baik saja.

471
00:38:29,390 --> 00:38:30,516
Dia masih hidup.

472
00:38:31,559 --> 00:38:33,102
Dia masih bertarung.

473
00:38:34,812 --> 00:38:36,605
Seikai kuat!

474
00:38:38,274 --> 00:38:40,318
Dia memang adikmu.

475
00:38:41,944 --> 00:38:43,237
Syukurlah…

476
00:38:52,496 --> 00:38:53,748
Seikai…

477
00:38:56,917 --> 00:38:58,711
Aku tak mau sendirian.

478
00:39:03,424 --> 00:39:06,427
Ayo buka kedai makan bersama.

479
00:39:07,762 --> 00:39:10,181
Aku yakin kondisimu juga akan membaik.

480
00:39:10,848 --> 00:39:12,600
Kau akan segera pulih…

481
00:39:15,394 --> 00:39:18,272
Ayo menjalani hidup kita…

482
00:39:20,066 --> 00:39:21,734
bersama…

483
00:39:23,736 --> 00:39:24,904
Pasti bisa.

484
00:39:28,824 --> 00:39:30,034
Bersama,

485
00:39:31,827 --> 00:39:33,329
pasti bisa…

486
00:40:05,194 --> 00:40:06,278
Ayo.

487
00:40:20,418 --> 00:40:23,754
Astaga, kau diserang habis-habisan.

488
00:40:23,838 --> 00:40:26,090
Siapa kau?

489
00:40:33,222 --> 00:40:36,517
Kutemukan.

490
00:40:38,727 --> 00:40:40,062
Aneh.

491
00:40:40,146 --> 00:40:40,980
Apa?

492
00:40:41,063 --> 00:40:42,690
Kenapa Hanzo belum muncul?

493
00:40:50,781 --> 00:40:52,741
Ternyata selama ini kau di sini.

494
00:40:53,367 --> 00:40:55,453
Hattori Hanzo.

495
00:40:56,036 --> 00:40:58,873
Kau mengirim pasukanmu
untuk membuka jalan ke markas kami,

496
00:40:59,790 --> 00:41:02,168
lalu mengikuti dari belakang.

497
00:41:03,002 --> 00:41:04,920
Sungguh taktik pengecut.

498
00:41:05,796 --> 00:41:08,424
Ternyata kau tahu rencana kami selama ini.

499
00:41:10,176 --> 00:41:11,469
Apa yang lucu?

500
00:41:13,429 --> 00:41:14,597
Empat kembar.

501
00:41:15,431 --> 00:41:17,349
Tampaknya kematian menanti kita berdua.

502
00:41:18,642 --> 00:41:20,102
Kau…

503
00:41:20,186 --> 00:41:21,896
Ahli seratus seni ninja,

504
00:41:23,230 --> 00:41:25,232
Nezu Jinpachi.

505
00:41:25,858 --> 00:41:28,903
Okuni sialan itu menipuku.

506
00:41:45,085 --> 00:41:47,213
Akan kuberi tahu…

507
00:41:49,673 --> 00:41:53,886
apa perintah sebenarnya…

508
00:41:56,180 --> 00:41:58,015
dari Tuan Yukimura.

509
00:42:01,644 --> 00:42:05,523
IKUTI KATA HATIMU
YUKIMURA

510
00:42:13,113 --> 00:42:15,533
Kau tak akan pernah paham.

511
00:42:16,700 --> 00:42:19,954
Pertaruhan terbesar dalam hidup…

512
00:42:26,126 --> 00:42:29,296
adalah memercayai seseorang.

513
00:42:31,465 --> 00:42:32,716
Kobaran Api!

514
00:42:37,304 --> 00:42:38,639
Ada asap…

515
00:42:40,641 --> 00:42:41,976
Jangan lihat ke belakang!

516
00:42:43,602 --> 00:42:46,730
Jangan biarkan pengorbanan Nezu sia-sia.

517
00:42:48,274 --> 00:42:49,441
Ayo.

518
00:42:57,199 --> 00:42:58,200
Maju!

519
00:43:01,453 --> 00:43:03,539
Itu dia. Markas musuh.

520
00:43:03,622 --> 00:43:05,958
Musuh menyerang!

521
00:43:06,041 --> 00:43:07,835
Sanada datang!

522
00:43:22,474 --> 00:43:23,934
Ieyasu!

523
00:43:24,018 --> 00:43:25,394
Yukimura.

524
00:43:26,520 --> 00:43:29,106
Tak kusangka kau akan sampai sejauh ini.

525
00:43:29,732 --> 00:43:31,859
Layak dipuji, meski kau musuhku.

526
00:43:33,736 --> 00:43:37,406
Namun, apa pedangmu bisa menjangkauku?

527
00:43:59,720 --> 00:44:00,638
Sasuke!

528
00:44:00,721 --> 00:44:01,930
Kau masih hidup.

529
00:44:02,014 --> 00:44:03,349
Tentu saja.

530
00:44:04,183 --> 00:44:06,185
Serahkan kroco kepada kami!

531
00:44:14,193 --> 00:44:15,319
Tunggu.

532
00:44:17,237 --> 00:44:18,614
Habisi dia, Pak Tua!

533
00:44:20,741 --> 00:44:24,244
Akhiri zaman sialan ini!

534
00:44:24,328 --> 00:44:25,162
Tunggu!

535
00:44:40,344 --> 00:44:43,180
Kita berhasil! Hore!

536
00:44:44,181 --> 00:44:45,599
Belum.

537
00:44:48,102 --> 00:44:50,020
Orang ini bukan Ieyasu.

538
00:44:50,729 --> 00:44:51,980
Apa maksudmu?

539
00:44:52,606 --> 00:44:53,941
Orang pengganti.

540
00:44:54,650 --> 00:44:56,026
Mustahil.

541
00:45:01,407 --> 00:45:04,034
Sanada telah tiba di markas kita.

542
00:45:04,118 --> 00:45:06,161
Untung kita sudah berjaga-jaga.

543
00:45:06,245 --> 00:45:07,538
Benar.

544
00:45:07,621 --> 00:45:11,333
Aku penasaran seperti apa
ekspresi Sanada sekarang.

545
00:45:14,169 --> 00:45:16,463
Keputusasaan sejati datang

546
00:45:17,506 --> 00:45:19,383
ketika harapan direnggut.

547
00:45:31,270 --> 00:45:33,689
Setelah semua ini,

548
00:45:33,772 --> 00:45:35,441
kita masih belum mendapatkannya?

549
00:45:36,358 --> 00:45:37,317
Ayo cari dia.

550
00:45:37,901 --> 00:45:39,653
Dia pasti belum pergi jauh.

551
00:45:40,237 --> 00:45:41,363
Ya, Tuanku.

552
00:45:41,447 --> 00:45:43,240
Ieyasu…

553
00:45:43,782 --> 00:45:45,576
Akan kubunuh bajingan itu.

554
00:45:46,326 --> 00:45:48,704
Masih gampang marah seperti biasa.

555
00:45:54,960 --> 00:45:56,253
Saizo?

556
00:45:56,920 --> 00:46:00,007
Kau masih hidup?

557
00:46:12,644 --> 00:46:13,562
Kenapa…

558
00:46:13,645 --> 00:46:15,898
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Andrea Altini

559
00:46:15,981 --> 00:46:17,858
DRAMA INI ADALAH KARYA FIKSI

